     "email_pre_header": "Pick up right where you left off.",
     "email_body": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"primary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":881668,\"width\":\"200px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com\"><img src=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/logo-5.png\" alt=\"GravityKit\" class=\"wp-image-881668\" style=\"width:200px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"filter-md\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-filter-md-font-size\">Hi {{contact.first_name|there}},</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Looks like you didn’t finish upgrading to {{ab_cart_edd_upgrade.new_plan_name|your new plan}}. It’s saved, so you can pick up where you left off:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#1877f2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"##ab_cart_edd_upgrade.recovery_url##\" style=\"background-color:#1877f2\">Finish My Upgrade</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You get credit for your current {{ab_cart_edd_upgrade.current_product|GravityKit}} license, so the upgrade is just {{ab_cart_edd_upgrade.today_price}} today. {{ab_cart_edd_upgrade.renewal_line}}</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If anything went wrong at checkout, just reply and we’ll sort it out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>P.S. Not sure the bigger plan is right for you? <a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/consultation/\">Book a free 1-on-1 call with me</a> and we’ll work out what fits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b7280\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:14px\">Don’t want these reminders? <a href=\"##ab_cart_edd_upgrade.stop_url##\">Stop these emails</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n",
